{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2021-07-26 16:15:00', 'title': 'DOVER ACQUIRES CDS VISUAL', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL., JULY 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DOVER (NYSE: DOV) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF CDS VISUAL, INC. ("CDS VISUAL"), WHICH WILL BECOME AN OPERATING COMPANY WITHIN DOVER\'S ENGINEERED PRODUCTS SEGMENT.'}